{"duration": 150.6, "beats": [{"text": "Ton cerveau te fait perdre de l'argent.", "start": 0.06, "end": 1.8, "words": [{"w": "Ton", "s": 0.06, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 0.26, "e": 0.6}, {"w": "te", "s": 0.64, "e": 0.74}, {"w": "fait", "s": 0.78, "e": 0.98}, {"w": "perdre", "s": 1.02, "e": 1.32}, {"w": "de", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.42}, {"w": "l'argent.", "s": 1.46, "e": 1.8}]}, {"text": "Et il le fait exprès.", "start": 2.22, "end": 3.22, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 2.22, "e": 2.26}, {"w": "il", "s": 2.28, "e": 2.36}, {"w": "le", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.52}, {"w": "fait", "s": 2.56, "e": 2.72}, {"w": "exprès.", "s": 2.78, "e": 3.22}]}, {"text": "Pendant des milliers d'années, il n'a appris qu'une chose : survivre.", "start": 4.26, "end": 7.38, "words": [{"w": "Pendant", "s": 4.26, "e": 4.46}, {"w": "des", "s": 4.5, "e": 4.619}, {"w": "milliers", "s": 4.74, "e": 5.0}, {"w": "d'années,", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.32}, {"w": "il", "s": 5.54, "e": 5.6}, {"w": "n'a", "s": 5.64, "e": 5.72}, {"w": "appris", "s": 5.78, "e": 5.98}, {"w": "qu'une", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.2}, {"w": "chose :", "s": 6.24, "e": 6.5}, {"w": "survivre.", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.38}]}, {"text": "Fuir le danger.", "start": 7.86, "end": 8.48, "words": [{"w": "Fuir", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.06}, {"w": "le", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.16}, {"w": "danger.", "s": 8.2, "e": 8.48}]}, {"text": "Suivre le groupe.", "start": 8.86, "end": 9.54, "words": [{"w": "Suivre", "s": 8.86, "e": 9.14}, {"w": "le", "s": 9.18, "e": 9.24}, {"w": "groupe.", "s": 9.28, "e": 9.54}]}, {"text": "Agir vite.", "start": 9.86, "end": 10.42, "words": [{"w": "Agir", "s": 9.86, "e": 10.1}, {"w": "vite.", "s": 10.16, "e": 10.42}]}, {"text": "Parfait dans la savane…", "start": 11.02, "end": 11.94, "words": [{"w": "Parfait", "s": 11.02, "e": 11.32}, {"w": "dans", "s": 11.34, "e": 11.42}, {"w": "la", "s": 11.46, "e": 11.54}, {"w": "savane…", "s": 11.58, "e": 11.94}]}, {"text": "catastrophique sur les marchés.", "start": 12.38, "end": 13.68, "words": [{"w": "catastrophique", "s": 12.38, "e": 13.02}, {"w": "sur", "s": 13.08, "e": 13.16}, {"w": "les", "s": 13.2, "e": 13.26}, {"w": "marchés.", "s": 13.3, "e": 13.68}]}, {"text": "Regarde.", "start": 14.54, "end": 14.86, "words": [{"w": "Regarde.", "s": 14.54, "e": 14.86}]}, {"text": "Quand tout le monde achète, il te pousse à acheter.", "start": 15.28, "end": 17.26, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 15.28, "e": 15.42}, {"w": "tout", "s": 15.48, "e": 15.54}, {"w": "le", "s": 15.56, "e": 15.6}, {"w": "monde", "s": 15.62, "e": 15.74}, {"w": "achète,", "s": 15.8, "e": 16.12}, {"w": "il", "s": 16.32, "e": 16.42}, {"w": "te", "s": 16.46, "e": 16.62}, {"w": "pousse", "s": 16.68, "e": 16.86}, {"w": "à", "s": 16.9, "e": 16.94}, {"w": "acheter.", "s": 16.979, "e": 17.26}]}, {"text": "Au plus haut.", "start": 17.58, "end": 18.08, "words": [{"w": "Au", "s": 17.58, "e": 17.62}, {"w": "plus", "s": 17.72, "e": 17.86}, {"w": "haut.", "s": 17.88, "e": 18.08}]}, {"text": "Quand ça baisse, il espère : tu gardes ta perte, trop longtemps.", "start": 18.56, "end": 21.78, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 18.56, "e": 18.66}, {"w": "ça", "s": 18.72, "e": 18.82}, {"w": "baisse,", "s": 18.86, "e": 19.16}, {"w": "il", "s": 19.38, "e": 19.44}, {"w": "espère :", "s": 19.5, "e": 19.86}, {"w": "tu", "s": 20.22, "e": 20.3}, {"w": "gardes", "s": 20.36, "e": 20.58}, {"w": "ta", "s": 20.62, "e": 20.74}, {"w": "perte,", "s": 20.78, "e": 21.22}, {"w": "trop", "s": 21.28, "e": 21.44}, {"w": "longtemps.", "s": 21.46, "e": 21.78}]}, {"text": "Quand ça monte, il a peur : tu revends ton gain, trop tôt.", "start": 22.38, "end": 25.4, "words": [{"w": "Quand", "s": 22.38, "e": 22.5}, {"w": "ça", "s": 22.56, "e": 22.62}, {"w": "monte,", "s": 22.7, "e": 22.92}, {"w": "il", "s": 23.12, "e": 23.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.22, "e": 23.3}, {"w": "peur :", "s": 23.36, "e": 23.62}, {"w": "tu", "s": 23.94, "e": 24.06}, {"w": "revends", "s": 24.12, "e": 24.36}, {"w": "ton", "s": 24.4, "e": 24.54}, {"w": "gain,", "s": 24.58, "e": 24.74}, {"w": "trop", "s": 25.02, "e": 25.22}, {"w": "tôt.", "s": 25.26, "e": 25.4}]}, {"text": "Et après une perte, il veut se venger : tu mises plus…", "start": 26.0, "end": 28.8, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 26.0, "e": 26.04}, {"w": "après", "s": 26.1, "e": 26.28}, {"w": "une", "s": 26.3, "e": 26.42}, {"w": "perte,", "s": 26.46, "e": 26.72}, {"w": "il", "s": 26.9, "e": 27.0}, {"w": "veut", "s": 27.02, "e": 27.14}, {"w": "se", "s": 27.18, "e": 27.32}, {"w": "venger :", "s": 27.38, "e": 27.7}, {"w": "tu", "s": 28.1, "e": 28.2}, {"w": "mises", "s": 28.26, "e": 28.46}, {"w": "plus…", "s": 28.5, "e": 28.8}]}, {"text": "tu perds plus.", "start": 29.1, "end": 29.9, "words": [{"w": "tu", "s": 29.1, "e": 29.16}, {"w": "perds", "s": 29.32, "e": 29.52}, {"w": "plus.", "s": 29.58, "e": 29.9}]}, {"text": "Ajoute ta journée : réunions, mails, trajets.", "start": 31.0, "end": 33.8, "words": [{"w": "Ajoute", "s": 31.0, "e": 31.22}, {"w": "ta", "s": 31.26, "e": 31.36}, {"w": "journée :", "s": 31.4, "e": 31.7}, {"w": "réunions,", "s": 32.14, "e": 32.6}, {"w": "mails,", "s": 32.86, "e": 33.14}, {"w": "trajets.", "s": 33.32, "e": 33.8}]}, {"text": "Le soir, ton cerveau a déjà pris des centaines de décisions.", "start": 34.18, "end": 36.96, "words": [{"w": "Le", "s": 34.18, "e": 34.3}, {"w": "soir,", "s": 34.34, "e": 34.64}, {"w": "ton", "s": 34.78, "e": 34.9}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 34.94, "e": 35.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 35.22, "e": 35.26}, {"w": "déjà", "s": 35.3, "e": 35.52}, {"w": "pris", "s": 35.54, "e": 35.68}, {"w": "des", "s": 35.72, "e": 35.86}, {"w": "centaines", "s": 35.98, "e": 36.36}, {"w": "de", "s": 36.4, "e": 36.48}, {"w": "décisions.", "s": 36.52, "e": 36.96}]}, {"text": "Il est épuisé.", "start": 37.32, "end": 38.14, "words": [{"w": "Il", "s": 37.32, "e": 37.38}, {"w": "est", "s": 37.42, "e": 37.64}, {"w": "épuisé.", "s": 37.7, "e": 38.14}]}, {"text": "Et c'est là que tu voudrais trader ?", "start": 38.62, "end": 39.84, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 38.62, "e": 38.7}, {"w": "c'est", "s": 38.76, "e": 38.88}, {"w": "là", "s": 39.0, "e": 39.1}, {"w": "que", "s": 39.16, "e": 39.2}, {"w": "tu", "s": 39.24, "e": 39.32}, {"w": "voudrais", "s": 39.34, "e": 39.58}, {"w": "trader ?", "s": 39.62, "e": 39.84}]}, {"text": "Les meilleurs l'ont compris depuis longtemps.", "start": 41.14, "end": 42.66, "words": [{"w": "Les", "s": 41.14, "e": 41.22}, {"w": "meilleurs", "s": 41.26, "e": 41.56}, {"w": "l'ont", "s": 41.58, "e": 41.68}, {"w": "compris", "s": 41.72, "e": 41.96}, {"w": "depuis", "s": 42.0, "e": 42.22}, {"w": "longtemps.", "s": 42.3, "e": 42.66}]}, {"text": "Ils ne sont pas plus intelligents que toi.", "start": 43.08, "end": 44.42, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "s": 43.08, "e": 43.14}, {"w": "ne", "s": 43.16, "e": 43.22}, {"w": "sont", "s": 43.28, "e": 43.4}, {"w": "pas", "s": 43.44, "e": 43.56}, {"w": "plus", "s": 43.58, "e": 43.7}, {"w": "intelligents", "s": 43.74, "e": 44.14}, {"w": "que", "s": 44.16, "e": 44.22}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 44.26, "e": 44.42}]}, {"text": "Ils ont simplement retiré leur cerveau de l'équation.", "start": 45.3, "end": 47.5, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "s": 45.3, "e": 45.42}, {"w": "ont", "s": 45.44, "e": 45.58}, {"w": "simplement", "s": 45.66, "e": 46.1}, {"w": "retiré", "s": 46.16, "e": 46.5}, {"w": "leur", "s": 46.54, "e": 46.64}, {"w": "cerveau", "s": 46.7, "e": 46.96}, {"w": "de", "s": 46.98, "e": 47.02}, {"w": "l'équation.", "s": 47.04, "e": 47.5}]}, {"text": "Leur secret tient en une phrase : décider avant.", "start": 48.38, "end": 51.3, "words": [{"w": "Leur", "s": 48.38, "e": 48.48}, {"w": "secret", "s": 48.56, "e": 48.88}, {"w": "tient", "s": 48.92, "e": 49.1}, {"w": "en", "s": 49.16, "e": 49.26}, {"w": "une", "s": 49.34, "e": 49.46}, {"w": "phrase :", "s": 49.5, "e": 49.82}, {"w": "décider", "s": 50.34, "e": 50.96}, {"w": "avant.", "s": 51.06, "e": 51.3}]}, {"text": "À froid.", "start": 51.68, "end": 52.06, "words": [{"w": "À", "s": 51.68, "e": 51.7}, {"w": "froid.", "s": 51.8, "e": 52.06}]}, {"text": "Des règles écrites à l'avance : si tout est réuni, on agit.", "start": 52.62, "end": 55.7, "words": [{"w": "Des", "s": 52.62, "e": 52.7}, {"w": "règles", "s": 52.74, "e": 53.04}, {"w": "écrites", "s": 53.1, "e": 53.36}, {"w": "à", "s": 53.4, "e": 53.42}, {"w": "l'avance :", "s": 53.46, "e": 53.88}, {"w": "si", "s": 54.26, "e": 54.32}, {"w": "tout", "s": 54.42, "e": 54.56}, {"w": "est", "s": 54.58, "e": 54.66}, {"w": "réuni,", "s": 54.7, "e": 55.02}, {"w": "on", "s": 55.32, "e": 55.4}, {"w": "agit.", "s": 55.48, "e": 55.7}]}, {"text": "Sinon, on attend.", "start": 56.1, "end": 57.1, "words": [{"w": "Sinon,", "s": 56.1, "e": 56.38}, {"w": "on", "s": 56.68, "e": 56.78}, {"w": "attend.", "s": 56.84, "e": 57.1}]}, {"text": "Et la limite de perte est posée avant même d'entrer.", "start": 57.54, "end": 59.88, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 57.54, "e": 57.6}, {"w": "la", "s": 57.64, "e": 57.7}, {"w": "limite", "s": 57.74, "e": 57.98}, {"w": "de", "s": 58.02, "e": 58.08}, {"w": "perte", "s": 58.18, "e": 58.38}, {"w": "est", "s": 58.4, "e": 58.5}, {"w": "posée", "s": 58.54, "e": 58.86}, {"w": "avant", "s": 58.96, "e": 59.24}, {"w": "même", "s": 59.3, "e": 59.46}, {"w": "d'entrer.", "s": 59.5, "e": 59.88}]}, {"text": "Longtemps, cette discipline était réservée aux pros.", "start": 60.86, "end": 62.92, "words": [{"w": "Longtemps,", "s": 60.86, "e": 61.22}, {"w": "cette", "s": 61.42, "e": 61.56}, {"w": "discipline", "s": 61.58, "e": 61.96}, {"w": "était", "s": 62.0, "e": 62.14}, {"w": "réservée", "s": 62.18, "e": 62.54}, {"w": "aux", "s": 62.58, "e": 62.68}, {"w": "pros.", "s": 62.72, "e": 62.92}]}, {"text": "C'est exactement ce que Compound Capital a construit pour toi.", "start": 63.74, "end": 66.54, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "s": 63.74, "e": 63.92}, {"w": "exactement", "s": 63.98, "e": 64.62}, {"w": "ce", "s": 64.68, "e": 64.72}, {"w": "que", "s": 64.74, "e": 64.86}, {"w": "Compound", "s": 64.9, "e": 65.24}, {"w": "Capital", "s": 65.3, "e": 65.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 65.74, "e": 65.8}, {"w": "construit", "s": 65.84, "e": 66.16}, {"w": "pour", "s": 66.2, "e": 66.3}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 66.36, "e": 66.54}]}, {"text": "Une stratégie automatique sur l'euro-dollar, le marché le plus échangé au monde.", "start": 67.0, "end": 70.86, "words": [{"w": "Une", "s": 67.0, "e": 67.08}, {"w": "stratégie", "s": 67.14, "e": 67.66}, {"w": "automatique", "s": 67.7, "e": 68.239}, {"w": "sur", "s": 68.3, "e": 68.42}, {"w": "l'euro-dollar,", "s": 68.48, "e": 69.04}, {"w": "le", "s": 69.32, "e": 69.4}, {"w": "marché", "s": 69.44, "e": 69.7}, {"w": "le", "s": 69.74, "e": 69.78}, {"w": "plus", "s": 69.86, "e": 70.06}, {"w": "échangé", "s": 70.12, "e": 70.48}, {"w": "au", "s": 70.5, "e": 70.56}, {"w": "monde.", "s": 70.64, "e": 70.86}]}, {"text": "Un seul marché, étudié par cœur.", "start": 71.34, "end": 73.38, "words": [{"w": "Un", "s": 71.34, "e": 71.4}, {"w": "seul", "s": 71.48, "e": 71.62}, {"w": "marché,", "s": 71.66, "e": 72.0}, {"w": "étudié", "s": 72.36, "e": 72.84}, {"w": "par", "s": 72.88, "e": 73.0}, {"w": "cœur.", "s": 73.1, "e": 73.38}]}, {"text": "Elle lit les chiffres, pas les rumeurs.", "start": 73.86, "end": 75.52, "words": [{"w": "Elle", "s": 73.86, "e": 73.98}, {"w": "lit", "s": 74.02, "e": 74.12}, {"w": "les", "s": 74.16, "e": 74.28}, {"w": "chiffres,", "s": 74.34, "e": 74.66}, {"w": "pas", "s": 74.9, "e": 74.98}, {"w": "les", "s": 75.02, "e": 75.08}, {"w": "rumeurs.", "s": 75.12, "e": 75.52}]}, {"text": "Elle applique ses règles sans émotion, du lundi au vendredi.", "start": 75.9, "end": 79.0, "words": [{"w": "Elle", "s": 75.9, "e": 75.98}, {"w": "applique", "s": 76.02, "e": 76.26}, {"w": "ses", "s": 76.32, "e": 76.42}, {"w": "règles", "s": 76.46, "e": 76.78}, {"w": "sans", "s": 76.86, "e": 77.02}, {"w": "émotion,", "s": 77.08, "e": 77.5}, {"w": "du", "s": 77.8, "e": 77.88}, {"w": "lundi", "s": 77.98, "e": 78.4}, {"w": "au", "s": 78.44, "e": 78.5}, {"w": "vendredi.", "s": 78.56, "e": 79.0}]}, {"text": "Et toi, tu n'as rien à faire : pas de graphique à surveiller, pas de signal à suivre, rien à cliquer.", "start": 79.46, "end": 84.84, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 79.46, "e": 79.54}, {"w": "toi,", "s": 79.58, "e": 79.74}, {"w": "tu", "s": 80.12, "e": 80.18}, {"w": "n'as", "s": 80.22, "e": 80.34}, {"w": "rien", "s": 80.42, "e": 80.62}, {"w": "à", "s": 80.66, "e": 80.76}, {"w": "faire :", "s": 80.8, "e": 81.04}, {"w": "pas", "s": 81.46, "e": 81.54}, {"w": "de", "s": 81.58, "e": 81.62}, {"w": "graphique", "s": 81.64, "e": 81.96}, {"w": "à", "s": 82.0, "e": 82.04}, {"w": "surveiller,", "s": 82.08, "e": 82.52}, {"w": "pas", "s": 82.9, "e": 82.98}, {"w": "de", "s": 83.02, "e": 83.06}, {"w": "signal", "s": 83.12, "e": 83.36}, {"w": "à", "s": 83.4, "e": 83.48}, {"w": "suivre,", "s": 83.52, "e": 83.82}, {"w": "rien", "s": 84.18, "e": 84.4}, {"w": "à", "s": 84.44, "e": 84.5}, {"w": "cliquer.", "s": 84.52, "e": 84.84}]}, {"text": "Concrètement ?", "start": 85.76, "end": 86.2, "words": [{"w": "Concrètement ?", "s": 85.76, "e": 86.2}]}, {"text": "Tu ouvres un compte à ton nom, chez notre courtier partenaire.", "start": 86.74, "end": 89.22, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 86.74, "e": 86.8}, {"w": "ouvres", "s": 86.84, "e": 87.0}, {"w": "un", "s": 87.04, "e": 87.14}, {"w": "compte", "s": 87.16, "e": 87.34}, {"w": "à", "s": 87.38, "e": 87.48}, {"w": "ton", "s": 87.52, "e": 87.62}, {"w": "nom,", "s": 87.7, "e": 87.82}, {"w": "chez", "s": 87.98, "e": 88.08}, {"w": "notre", "s": 88.1, "e": 88.34}, {"w": "courtier", "s": 88.38, "e": 88.68}, {"w": "partenaire.", "s": 88.72, "e": 89.22}]}, {"text": "Tu y déposes ton capital.", "start": 89.64, "end": 90.76, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 89.64, "e": 89.7}, {"w": "y", "s": 89.74, "e": 89.8}, {"w": "déposes", "s": 89.84, "e": 90.14}, {"w": "ton", "s": 90.16, "e": 90.26}, {"w": "capital.", "s": 90.3, "e": 90.76}]}, {"text": "Tu demandes l'accès.", "start": 91.12, "end": 91.9, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 91.12, "e": 91.18}, {"w": "demandes", "s": 91.28, "e": 91.54}, {"w": "l'accès.", "s": 91.56, "e": 91.9}]}, {"text": "Et chaque position de la stratégie se copie automatiquement chez toi.", "start": 92.36, "end": 95.4, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 92.36, "e": 92.46}, {"w": "chaque", "s": 92.54, "e": 92.74}, {"w": "position", "s": 92.78, "e": 93.16}, {"w": "de", "s": 93.2, "e": 93.26}, {"w": "la", "s": 93.3, "e": 93.34}, {"w": "stratégie", "s": 93.4, "e": 93.82}, {"w": "se", "s": 93.9, "e": 94.0}, {"w": "copie", "s": 94.04, "e": 94.4}, {"w": "automatiquement", "s": 94.44, "e": 95.04}, {"w": "chez", "s": 95.08, "e": 95.2}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 95.24, "e": 95.4}]}, {"text": "Ton argent ne quitte jamais ton compte : personne d'autre que toi ne peut le retirer.", "start": 96.34, "end": 100.12, "words": [{"w": "Ton", "s": 96.34, "e": 96.44}, {"w": "argent", "s": 96.52, "e": 96.72}, {"w": "ne", "s": 96.76, "e": 96.82}, {"w": "quitte", "s": 96.9, "e": 97.14}, {"w": "jamais", "s": 97.22, "e": 97.46}, {"w": "ton", "s": 97.5, "e": 97.64}, {"w": "compte :", "s": 97.68, "e": 97.92}, {"w": "personne", "s": 98.32, "e": 98.66}, {"w": "d'autre", "s": 98.7, "e": 98.96}, {"w": "que", "s": 99.0, "e": 99.14}, {"w": "toi", "s": 99.2, "e": 99.36}, {"w": "ne", "s": 99.4, "e": 99.46}, {"w": "peut", "s": 99.54, "e": 99.6}, {"w": "le", "s": 99.64, "e": 99.68}, {"w": "retirer.", "s": 99.72, "e": 100.12}]}, {"text": "Et tu peux tout arrêter, quand tu veux.", "start": 100.52, "end": 102.24, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 100.52, "e": 100.58}, {"w": "tu", "s": 100.62, "e": 100.66}, {"w": "peux", "s": 100.74, "e": 100.92}, {"w": "tout", "s": 100.96, "e": 101.12}, {"w": "arrêter,", "s": 101.18, "e": 101.5}, {"w": "quand", "s": 101.8, "e": 101.92}, {"w": "tu", "s": 101.96, "e": 102.04}, {"w": "veux.", "s": 102.12, "e": 102.24}]}, {"text": "Et nous, dans tout ça ?", "start": 103.16, "end": 103.96, "words": [{"w": "Et", "s": 103.16, "e": 103.22}, {"w": "nous,", "s": 103.28, "e": 103.38}, {"w": "dans", "s": 103.6, "e": 103.7}, {"w": "tout", "s": 103.72, "e": 103.82}, {"w": "ça ?", "s": 103.88, "e": 103.96}]}, {"text": "On n'est payés que sur les gains.", "start": 104.48, "end": 105.72, "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 104.48, "e": 104.54}, {"w": "n'est", "s": 104.58, "e": 104.7}, {"w": "payés", "s": 104.72, "e": 105.04}, {"w": "que", "s": 105.08, "e": 105.22}, {"w": "sur", "s": 105.26, "e": 105.38}, {"w": "les", "s": 105.42, "e": 105.52}, {"w": "gains.", "s": 105.56, "e": 105.72}]}, {"text": "Pas de gain, pas de commission.", "start": 106.1, "end": 107.42, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "s": 106.1, "e": 106.18}, {"w": "de", "s": 106.22, "e": 106.28}, {"w": "gain,", "s": 106.32, "e": 106.48}, {"w": "pas", "s": 106.8, "e": 106.86}, {"w": "de", "s": 106.9, "e": 106.94}, {"w": "commission.", "s": 106.98, "e": 107.42}]}, {"text": "Notre intérêt est simple : que ton compte progresse.", "start": 107.84, "end": 110.34, "words": [{"w": "Notre", "s": 107.84, "e": 108.0}, {"w": "intérêt", "s": 108.04, "e": 108.34}, {"w": "est", "s": 108.36, "e": 108.5}, {"w": "simple :", "s": 108.56, "e": 108.86}, {"w": "que", "s": 109.16, "e": 109.22}, {"w": "ton", "s": 109.3, "e": 109.38}, {"w": "compte", "s": 109.48, "e": 109.64}, {"w": "progresse.", "s": 109.76, "e": 110.34}]}, {"text": "Ici, pas de promesse en l'air, pas de capture d'écran.", "start": 111.28, "end": 113.76, "words": [{"w": "Ici,", "s": 111.28, "e": 111.6}, {"w": "pas", "s": 111.88, "e": 111.94}, {"w": "de", "s": 111.98, "e": 112.04}, {"w": "promesse", "s": 112.06, "e": 112.38}, {"w": "en", "s": 112.42, "e": 112.48}, {"w": "l'air,", "s": 112.52, "e": 112.74}, {"w": "pas", "s": 112.94, "e": 113.02}, {"w": "de", "s": 113.06, "e": 113.1}, {"w": "capture", "s": 113.14, "e": 113.42}, {"w": "d'écran.", "s": 113.44, "e": 113.76}]}, {"text": "Un historique en argent réel, vérifiable par n'importe qui, sur MyFxBook.", "start": 114.22, "end": 118.52, "words": [{"w": "Un", "s": 114.22, "e": 114.3}, {"w": "historique", "s": 114.32, "e": 114.72}, {"w": "en", "s": 114.76, "e": 114.84}, {"w": "argent", "s": 114.9, "e": 115.2}, {"w": "réel,", "s": 115.26, "e": 115.58}, {"w": "vérifiable", "s": 115.84, "e": 116.42}, {"w": "par", "s": 116.46, "e": 116.56}, {"w": "n'importe", "s": 116.66, "e": 117.08}, {"w": "qui,", "s": 117.18, "e": 117.3}, {"w": "sur", "s": 117.6, "e": 117.74}, {"w": "MyFxBook.", "s": 117.8, "e": 118.52}]}, {"text": "Pas besoin d'être trader pour le lire.", "start": 119.04, "end": 120.52, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "s": 119.04, "e": 119.14}, {"w": "besoin", "s": 119.16, "e": 119.38}, {"w": "d'être", "s": 119.42, "e": 119.66}, {"w": "trader", "s": 119.7, "e": 120.04}, {"w": "pour", "s": 120.06, "e": 120.16}, {"w": "le", "s": 120.18, "e": 120.26}, {"w": "lire.", "s": 120.3, "e": 120.52}]}, {"text": "Juste de vouloir comprendre.", "start": 120.92, "end": 122.22, "words": [{"w": "Juste", "s": 120.92, "e": 121.24}, {"w": "de", "s": 121.28, "e": 121.4}, {"w": "vouloir", "s": 121.42, "e": 121.68}, {"w": "comprendre.", "s": 121.76, "e": 122.22}]}, {"text": "C'est d'ailleurs pour ça que l'accès se fait sur demande : on préfère des gens qui ont compris…", "start": 122.72, "end": 126.42, "words": [{"w": "C'est", "s": 122.72, "e": 122.78}, {"w": "d'ailleurs", "s": 122.8, "e": 123.06}, {"w": "pour", "s": 123.1, "e": 123.26}, {"w": "ça", "s": 123.32, "e": 123.38}, {"w": "que", "s": 123.46, "e": 123.54}, {"w": "l'accès", "s": 123.58, "e": 123.82}, {"w": "se", "s": 123.86, "e": 123.96}, {"w": "fait", "s": 124.0, "e": 124.1}, {"w": "sur", "s": 124.16, "e": 124.3}, {"w": "demande :", "s": 124.34, "e": 124.68}, {"w": "on", "s": 125.06, "e": 125.12}, {"w": "préfère", "s": 125.16, "e": 125.46}, {"w": "des", "s": 125.48, "e": 125.58}, {"w": "gens", "s": 125.6, "e": 125.76}, {"w": "qui", "s": 125.78, "e": 125.86}, {"w": "ont", "s": 125.88, "e": 126.0}, {"w": "compris…", "s": 126.06, "e": 126.42}]}, {"text": "à des gens pressés.", "start": 126.78, "end": 127.5, "words": [{"w": "à", "s": 126.78, "e": 126.8}, {"w": "des", "s": 126.84, "e": 126.94}, {"w": "gens", "s": 126.96, "e": 127.1}, {"w": "pressés.", "s": 127.14, "e": 127.5}]}, {"text": "Alors imagine.", "start": 128.62, "end": 129.2, "words": [{"w": "Alors", "s": 128.62, "e": 128.78}, {"w": "imagine.", "s": 128.82, "e": 129.2}]}, {"text": "Tu sors de ta réunion.", "start": 129.68, "end": 130.64, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 129.68, "e": 129.74}, {"w": "sors", "s": 129.86, "e": 130.0}, {"w": "de", "s": 130.04, "e": 130.12}, {"w": "ta", "s": 130.14, "e": 130.22}, {"w": "réunion.", "s": 130.28, "e": 130.64}]}, {"text": "Tu ouvres ton téléphone.", "start": 131.0, "end": 131.98, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 131.0, "e": 131.08}, {"w": "ouvres", "s": 131.12, "e": 131.32}, {"w": "ton", "s": 131.36, "e": 131.44}, {"w": "téléphone.", "s": 131.5, "e": 131.98}]}, {"text": "Pendant que tu vivais ta journée, ta stratégie a suivi ses règles.", "start": 132.48, "end": 135.5, "words": [{"w": "Pendant", "s": 132.48, "e": 132.68}, {"w": "que", "s": 132.72, "e": 132.8}, {"w": "tu", "s": 132.84, "e": 132.96}, {"w": "vivais", "s": 132.98, "e": 133.2}, {"w": "ta", "s": 133.24, "e": 133.34}, {"w": "journée,", "s": 133.38, "e": 133.68}, {"w": "ta", "s": 133.98, "e": 134.04}, {"w": "stratégie", "s": 134.119, "e": 134.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 134.619, "e": 134.7}, {"w": "suivi", "s": 134.76, "e": 135.0}, {"w": "ses", "s": 135.06, "e": 135.179}, {"w": "règles.", "s": 135.22, "e": 135.5}]}, {"text": "Sans stress.", "start": 135.899, "end": 136.459, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 135.899, "e": 136.02}, {"w": "stress.", "s": 136.1, "e": 136.459}]}, {"text": "Sans écran.", "start": 136.76, "end": 137.26, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 136.76, "e": 136.92}, {"w": "écran.", "s": 136.98, "e": 137.26}]}, {"text": "Sans toi.", "start": 137.64, "end": 138.02, "words": [{"w": "Sans", "s": 137.64, "e": 137.8}, {"w": "toi.", "s": 137.84, "e": 138.02}]}, {"text": "Tu gardes ton travail.", "start": 138.6, "end": 139.58, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "s": 138.6, "e": 138.66}, {"w": "gardes", "s": 138.74, "e": 139.0}, {"w": "ton", "s": 139.02, "e": 139.12}, {"w": "travail.", "s": 139.16, "e": 139.58}]}, {"text": "Elle garde la discipline.", "start": 139.94, "end": 141.08, "words": [{"w": "Elle", "s": 139.94, "e": 140.04}, {"w": "garde", "s": 140.16, "e": 140.38}, {"w": "la", "s": 140.42, "e": 140.5}, {"w": "discipline.", "s": 140.54, "e": 141.08}]}, {"text": "CTA", "start": 142.06, "end": 146.94, "words": []}, {"text": "Compound Capital.", "start": 147.44, "end": 148.38, "words": [{"w": "Compound", "s": 147.44, "e": 147.82}, {"w": "Capital.", "s": 147.88, "e": 148.38}]}, {"text": "Comprendre avant de décider.", "start": 148.86, "end": 150.38, "words": [{"w": "Comprendre", "s": 148.86, "e": 149.54}, {"w": "avant", "s": 149.62, "e": 149.82}, {"w": "de", "s": 149.86, "e": 149.92}, {"w": "décider.", "s": 149.96, "e": 150.38}]}]}